  "creative_revisions": [
    "R3 Sunken Crown: monumental asymmetrical anchored root vaults and platforms, clear central arrival.",
    "R3 Root Orchard: thick coherent rooted tree, buttress arches, visitable tiered shelves and differentiated crowns.",
    "R3 Spore Organ: large porous, rim-backed clustered sponge masses with open circular cavities and collection ledges.",
    "R3 Fossil Atrium and Calcite Observatory: grounded stepped fossil seating, unique supported observation portico and crystals.",
    "R3 Anastomosis and Moonwell: branching left arterial gallery, nested dry well terraces, clear mineral socket and outcrops.",
    "R3 Deep Bell: monumental anchored resonator shell, mineral clapper, and two grounded lower platforms.",
    "R4 Orchard: uneven rooted trunk, irregular canopy, connected cultivation terraces and cut western niches; not a circular-leaf stamp.",
    "R4 Spore Sanctuary: continuous branching tissue, five faceted pores, visitable collection ledges and open membrane threshold, replacing concentric rings.",
    "R4 Fossil and calcite: grounded stepped amphitheatre differentiated from load-bearing faceted mineral viewing station.",
    "R4 Artery/moonwell: full supported arterial junction and asymmetrical dry mineral terraces with open service alcoves.",
    "R5 Orchard and Spore: connected rooted inhabited terraces and large/mid/small natural tissue pores.",
    "R5 Fossil and Calcite: five grounded fossil seats with alcove versus faceted enclosed observation room and supported deck.",
    "R5 Lower loop: 3-stop basalt artery, dry moonwell basin, true apertures and mineral catch terraces.",
    "R6 Orchard: separate embedded cultivation pockets, rooted staggered seed stations and direct tree-to-terrace materials.",
    "R6 Spore: layered anisotropic membrane with individually carved pores, three service gills and retained return flight.",
    "R6 Fossil/Calcite/Moonwell: contrasted stepped fossil survey, backed optical portico and three dry mineral collection trays.",
    "R7 Orchard: separate west-rooted seed, harvest and mineral maintenance rooms with lateral mouths.",
    "R7 Spore: three unlike membrane/filter, porous sampler, dry return chambers on a supported eastern shell.",
    "R7 Fossil/Calcite: raked fossil inspection bowl vs enclosed faceted optical hall.",
    "R7 lower loop: dry basalt arterial inspection portal and dry rooted mineral catch basin."
  ],
